"""
Common Crawl CDX -> WARC (range fetch) -> HTML -> Trafilatura -> Clean dataset
Two-phase, professional workflow:

PHASE 1 (Index):  Query CDX once and cache to disk as JSONL:
    <out_dir>/cdx_pool.jsonl

PHASE 2 (Extract): Load cached pool and build:
    <out_dir>/dataset.txt   (one paragraph per line)
    <out_dir>/sources.csv   (domain,url samples for report)

PLUS: Metadata/Tag cleanup
- Drops lines that start with "Tags:"
- Removes trailing "Tags: ...." segments if appended at end of a line
- Drops metadata-heavy lines (many pipes) to avoid training noise

Colab install:
  !pip -q install aiohttp warcio trafilatura tldextract langdetect transformers
"""

